展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defined symbol and the symbol declared in the hypothesis now coincide; the comprehension is explicitly bounded by the ambient universe.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"a33dcee0f62c9026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ is the ambient universe and $\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}$ is the language predicate of [[93-df-language]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak L_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}languages}\\vdash \\mathfrak L_{93}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal L\\in V:\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":713,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["a33dcee0f62c9026"]}